{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"gate_stone","model_identifier":"gate_stone","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# gate_stone\n\nStone gate: three columns wide (48 u) along X; two leaves hinged at the posts open inward (+Z). Opening 32 u wide x 88 u tall. Clips `open` and `close`.\n\n- Footprint: 3 x 1 columns (48 x 16 units, 1.35 x 0.45 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -24..24, y 0..142, z -10..8 units.\n- Texture: 128 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 22, construction_0 14, construction_33 24, construction_66 27, ruined 4 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- posts: two 8 x 142 x 16 boxes at x -20 / +20\n- leaves (when closed): 32 x 90 x 4 at the origin; open leaves do not block\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `gate_stone_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `gate_stone_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_gate_stone` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `open` | 1.6 | once | leaves swing 95 degrees inward (+Z) and hold open. |\n| `close` | 1.6 | once | leaves swing shut and hold. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -16)\n"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"pier-1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-24.0,0.0,-8.0],"to":[-8.0,134.0,8.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[8.0,0.0,24.0,134.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[24.0,0.0,40.0,134.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[8.0,0.0,24.0,134.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[24.0,0.0,40.0,134.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[89.0,152.0,105.0,168.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[89.0,152.0,105.0,168.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"23b7e34d-fefe-5b3c-aee8-b592544f6327"},{"name":"pier1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[8.0,0.0,-8.0],"to":[24.0,134.0,8.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[40.0,0.0,56.0,134.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[24.0,0.0,40.0,134.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[40.0,0.0,56.0,134.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[24.0,0.0,40.0,134.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[105.0,152.0,121.0,168.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[105.0,152.0,121.0,168.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"4174dd80-cef0-59f5-81fe-f976c3881c0f"},{"name":"arch","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-16.0,92.0,-8.0],"to":[16.0,124.0,8.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[96.0,0.0,128.0,32.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,152.0,16.0,184.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[96.0,0.0,128.0,32.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,152.0,16.0,184.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[37.0,152.0,69.0,168.0