:[{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"69f552eb-3ed7-519b-bd17-a84c7a33e25a","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":-98.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"895c87ac-705f-56df-8de6-d636b5f13248","time":1.2,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":-95.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"55ad18d4-c58f-5078-8d17-1f1a85dbda61","time":1.6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]},"b08e68d5-0db8-5d60-8142-90a919d77395":{"name":"leaf_r","type":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"9780b4ec-9836-53c8-b164-3aa403f1526f","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":98.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"6fa07653-ba3a-5c85-bf9f-15a15ff6bc16","time":1.2,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":95.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"c6abbec6-515a-5c7a-9837-fad4c01e5cbb","time":1.6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}},{"uuid":"5dcf31e5-bf4f-5adb-8265-732f56ec77fa","name":"close","loop":"once","override":false,"length":1.6,"snapping":24,"selected":false,"anim_time_update":"","blend_weight":"","start_delay":"","loop_delay":"","animators":{"0b665880-7419-5fe1-934b-9486038b45ad":{"name":"leaf_l","type":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":-95.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"ade9038c-4021-5a49-95f8-68fc2eb7adf8","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":2.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"50e8331f-ec5c-57e6-ba0e-e02f4008c2b8","time":1.3,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"f0e0dc97-3353-5e0a-b611-71be8fd24bdb","time":1.6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]},"b08e68d5-0db8-5d60-8142-90a919d77395":{"name":"leaf_r","type":"bone","keyframes":[{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":95.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"5cc4e92d-36a1-5802-a3d4-15ddc04d90c0","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":-2.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"7d33397c-4460-50b7-bfcd-670082df6b56","time":1.3,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"8cbebec5-919e-5037-8295-baf9236e3fd0","time":1.6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}}],"description":"# gate_stone\n\nStone gate: three columns wide (48 u) along X; two leaves hinged at the posts open inward (+Z). Opening 32 u wide x 88 u tall. Clips `open` and `close`.\n\n- Footprint: 3 x 1 columns (48 x 16 units, 1.35 x 0.45 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -24..24, y 0..142, z -10..8 units.\n- Texture: 128 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 22, construction_0 14, construction_33 24, construction_66 27, ruined 4 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- posts: two 8 x 142 x 16 boxes at x -20 / +20\n- leaves (when closed): 32 x 90 x 4 at the origin; open leaves do not block\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `gate_stone_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `gate_stone_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_gate_stone` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `open` | 1.6 | once | leaves swing 95 degrees inward (+Z) and hold open. |\n| `close` | 1.6 | once | leaves swing shut and hold. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -16)\n"}